The commit message claims we `fill assembled block to max weight`, but we still have leftover transactions - can we assert the claim (and adjust the `FAN_OUT` to make it true? Just make sure the number is not `110`, we're still sensitive to that...)

```suggestion
    assert(GetBlockWeight(*PrepareBlock(test_setup->m_node, options)) > MAX_BLOCK_WEIGHT - DEFAULT_BLOCK_RESERVED_WEIGHT);
}
```

